/07/21192134/6929b940e4802cf13960acbb172247c2-2.jpg?width=1024 1024w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21192134/6929b940e4802cf13960acbb172247c2-2.jpg?width=1278 1278w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21192134/6929b940e4802cf13960acbb172247c2-2.jpg?width=1536 1536w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21192134/6929b940e4802cf13960acbb172247c2-2.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 485px) 45vw, 485px\" /></figure><div class=\"postbody archives_post__meta\"><div class=\"ttl\">「あつまれ！小学生」船穂小学校編（2026年6月20日放送）～ マスカットにスイートピー。自慢の特産品に囲まれて過ごす、船穂小学校の日々</div></div></a></li><li class=\"cat_postlist__li\"><a href=\"https://kuratoco.com/https-kuratoco-com-fmkurashiki-atsumare-43/\" class=\"cat_postlist__link no-icon\"><figure class=\"eyecatch of-cover\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"485\" height=\"364\" src=\"https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1-485x364.jpg\" class=\"archives-eyecatch-image attachment-oc-post-thum wp-post-image\" alt=\"倉敷西小学校アイキャッチ\" srcset=\"https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=320 320w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=485 485w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=600 600w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=768 768w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=800 800w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=852 852w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc519c4468d541cbcfe0072ef6-1.jpg?width=1024 1024w, https://media.kuratoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/15001618/4d2898cc